Open Surf Format
[/div]


Throughout the week, participants may enter the waves at any time and submit up to three independent surf runs.


Each run is judged on its own. No turn order. No brackets. No restrictions.


[center][size=140][b]
Just you, your Pokémon, and your quest for the perfect wave.
[/b][/size][/center]


[hr]


[b]Only your highest-scoring run counts toward final placement.[/b]


