How the Waves Are Judged
[/div]


Each run is evaluated across four categories:


[list]
[*][b]Style[/b] — Creativity, flair, and trick execution.
[*][b]Flow[/b] — Control, smoothness, and clean performance.
[*][b]Harmony[/b] — Coordination and trust between Trainer and Pokémon.
[*][b]Crowd Appeal[/b] — Presence, energy, and thematic performance.
[/list]


Each category is scored from [b]1–10[/b], creating a base score out of 40.


A light dice modifier reflects the ocean’s unpredictability.


[/div]




